\description{
Returns a closure \verb{function(t, ...)} where \code{surv(x)(t)} equals
\verb{reliability(x, surv(component(x, j))(t) for each j)}. This is the
classical identity \code{S_sys(t) = R(S(t))} realized as a composition.

